# This project does NOT require a server-side Gemini API key.
# Users enter their own key in the UI (右上角「發音調校」); it is sent only
# to /api/tts and proxied to Google via the x-goog-api-key header.
# Keep this file as a placeholder only — never commit real secrets.

# [選用 / Optional] 分散式跨實例互斥鎖與限流 (Distributed Lock & Rate Limit)
# 若部署至 Vercel 多實例生產環境，可直接綁定 Upstash Redis 或 Vercel KV：
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://xxxx.upstash.io
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=xxxx
# 或 Vercel KV：
# KV_REST_API_URL=https://xxxx.upstash.io
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=xxxx
# (若未設定，系統自動降級為模組層記憶體鎖與單分頁/跨分頁互斥防護)

